onboarding-window-title = Set up Vantage
onboarding-brand = Vantage
onboarding-brand-sub = Setup

onboarding-skip = Skip
onboarding-back = Back
onboarding-next = Continue
onboarding-finish = Finish

onboarding-welcome-eyebrow = Welcome
onboarding-welcome-title = Welcome to Vantage
onboarding-welcome-body = Take a minute to set up the look and the features you use. Everything can be changed later.
onboarding-welcome-point-esr = Built on Firefox ESR, with steady updates
onboarding-welcome-point-privacy = Tracking protection on, no usage data collected
onboarding-welcome-point-settings = Every option can be changed anytime

onboarding-appearance-eyebrow = Appearance
onboarding-appearance-title = Make it look like yours
onboarding-appearance-body = Pick what fits you. Every option can be changed later.
onboarding-theme-label = Vantage theme
onboarding-theme-desc = Blue palette shared by the toolbar, sidebar, and menus.
onboarding-variant-label = Interface style
onboarding-variant-desc = Nova is the Firefox 153 layout; Proton is the classic one.
onboarding-mode-label = Color mode
onboarding-mode-desc = Applies to the browser interface and default web colors.
onboarding-mode-auto = System
onboarding-mode-light = Light
onboarding-mode-dark = Dark
onboarding-density-label = Toolbar density
onboarding-density-desc = Normal is the default; Compact saves space; Touch is for touch screens.
onboarding-density-normal = Normal
onboarding-density-compact = Compact (experimental)
onboarding-density-touch = Touch
onboarding-theme-store-title = Want a different look?
onboarding-theme-store-desc = The theme store has more colors and backgrounds.
onboarding-theme-store-button = Browse themes
onboarding-theme-yield-note = When a third-party theme is enabled, the Vantage theme steps aside and leaves your theme untouched.

onboarding-custom-eyebrow = Customize
onboarding-custom-title = Customize your journey
onboarding-custom-body = A few settings worth deciding now. Only the common ones are listed here; more are in Settings.
onboarding-multithread-label = Multi-threaded downloads
onboarding-multithread-desc = Downloads in parallel when the server supports ranges, otherwise falls back to a single connection.
onboarding-sidebar-hover-label = Sidebar on hover
onboarding-sidebar-hover-desc = Move the pointer to the left edge of the window to open the sidebar.
onboarding-findbar-label = Chromium-style find bar
onboarding-tabs-unload-label = Unload inactive tabs
onboarding-tabs-unload-desc = Unloads inactive tabs when memory is low, and reloads them when needed.
onboarding-update-check-label = Check for updates
onboarding-update-check-desc = Checks for a new Vantage version at startup. It only notifies, never installs.
onboarding-ai-sidebar-label = AI sidebar
onboarding-ai-sidebar-desc = Opens AI chat in the sidebar, with DeepSeek, Qwen, Doubao, ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude.
onboarding-custom-note = The full list is in <a data-l10n-name="settings">Settings → Vantage</a>. You can change it anytime.

onboarding-privacy-eyebrow = Privacy
onboarding-privacy-title = Privacy is already set
onboarding-privacy-body = Vantage uses strict tracking protection by default, so there is no level to pick. If a site breaks because of it, you can relax protection for that site only.
onboarding-privacy-strict-label = Strict protection (default)
onboarding-privacy-strict-desc = Blocks known trackers, cross-site cookies, fingerprinting scripts, and miners. No extra setup needed.
onboarding-site-fixes-label = Fix minor site issues automatically
onboarding-site-fixes-desc = Automatically relaxes protection for known affected sites. Only those sites are affected; the global level stays the same.
onboarding-doh-label = DNS over HTTPS (DoH)
onboarding-doh-desc = Encrypts DNS queries. On by default, using regional servers, with a fallback to system DNS.
onboarding-privacy-note = If one site breaks, click the shield icon in the address bar to turn protection off for that site only.

onboarding-ext-eyebrow = Extensions
onboarding-ext-title = Extensions: two included
onboarding-ext-body = Both are enabled by default and can be disabled in the add-ons manager. Install anything else from the store.
onboarding-bundled = Included
onboarding-ext-cookies = I still don't care about cookies
onboarding-ext-cookies-desc = Handles cookie consent prompts automatically.
onboarding-ext-rightclick = Re-enable right click
onboarding-ext-rightclick-desc = Forces copying on pages that block right-click and copy.
onboarding-ext-store = Add-ons store
onboarding-ext-store-desc = Everything else lives here. Extensions installed in Vantage work the same as in Firefox.
onboarding-ext-store-button = Open the store
onboarding-ext-note = Permissions, updates, and disabling are managed in the <a data-l10n-name="addons">add-ons manager</a>.

onboarding-import-eyebrow = Import and default
onboarding-import-title = Two last things
onboarding-import-body = Bring over bookmarks, passwords, and history from another browser if you want, and make Vantage your default browser.
onboarding-import-label = Import from another browser
onboarding-import-desc = Bookmarks, passwords, history, extensions, and settings.
onboarding-import-button = Import…
onboarding-default-label = Set as default browser
onboarding-default-desc = Open web links in Vantage.
onboarding-import-note = Both can be changed later in Settings → General.

onboarding-done-title = All set
onboarding-done-body = You can reopen this guide from Settings → Vantage.
onboarding-done-close = Close
onboarding-done-newtab = Open a new tab
